# Stroke of Midnight: destroying an indestructible permanent does nothing, but its controller still creates the Human
# (2023-09-01 ruling). Bot1 casts it at Bot2's Mind Stone - a nonland permanent - and Bot2 answers with Boros Charm
# making its permanents indestructible: the Mind Stone stays, and Bot2, its controller, makes the 1/1 white Human.

